    "detail": "We only stayed one night as we were visiting relatives nearby. But will definitely stay here again if we come back to Taichung. The staff were extremely helpful and courteous, the hotel and the room was very clean. Bed and linen made it a very good night sleep. We had 2 rooms, the standard twin for my wife and I, and a standard double for our daughter. The layout was very good as the shower, toilet, and basin area was separated which means my wife and I can use it in parallel. The only comment is maybe there can be a stronger exhaust fan in the shower to get rid of the steam quicker. Other than that a fantastic hotel experience at a very good price.",
